{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/266444-wyld-shaping-a-legion-of-ever-solar-blight","id":266444,"title":"Wyld Shaping a Legion of Ever(Solar)blight","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-26T15:00:37-07:00","id":266444,"title":"Wyld Shaping a Legion of Ever(Solar)blight","content":"I noticed that wyld shaping can be used to generate essence 1 beings, cool, but then as I thought about it I realized that maybe I could use that power to generate more than just humans, perhaps I could use it to generate my own army. We are in a higher essence game (100 starting XP, and starting essence 6), that started with us being prisoners in malfeas being sloshed around in the sea of kimbery because we failed to get in, grab the Phylactery womb and get out. I'm a Dawn caste built for war and conquest, and the thought of making an angelius to ride in on should we go back to storm Malfeas. I also realized that perhaps using the blood of my dragon blooded companion I should be able to make all manner of fun creatures for us and even what could effectively be a giant (Low essence) behemoth<br /> <br /> SO, here is a big question, what would it take for a solar to be able to use Wyld Shaping techniques to form from the wyld his own force of beasts and custom mutants to serve him?<br /> Below are picture examples are along the veins of what I am trying to form. Along with what I figure the background would be for it. Please correct me as needed.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByT